# 🪔 Nepali Hindu Wedding Web App — Project Plan

> A personalized, admin-controlled wedding web app.
> **Hosting:** GitHub Pages (free) · **Data:** Google Sheets + Google Drive (free) · **Backend:** Google Apps Script (free)
> Includes a dedicated memorial section in loving memory of Mom 🙏.

---

## 1. Principles
- 💸 **100% free services only** — GitHub Pages, Google Apps Script, Google Sheets, Google Drive, Gmail, free CDN libraries.
- ⚙️ **Everything customizable** — every feature can be toggled ON/OFF by the admin.
- 🔒 **Nothing revealed early** — events unlock by time / tap / group, filtered **server-side**.
- 🌐 **Three language modes** — English, नेपाली, and Mixed (50% नेपाली + 50% English, shown side by side).
- ✏️ **Easy to edit** — admin panel forms, or edit the Google Sheet directly.
- 🙏 **Mom is part of everything** — memorial page plus her presence throughout.

