## 4. Language System (English / नेपाली / Mixed)

| Mode | Example |
|---|---|
| `en` | Register |
| `ne` | दर्ता गर्नुहोस् |
| `mix` (50/50) | दर्ता गर्नुहोस् · Register |

- Guest picks language from a toggle (remembered in browser).
- Admin sets the **default** language in Settings.
- All UI labels live in `js/i18n.js` (`{ en, ne }` pairs). Mixed mode renders both.
- Content (events, story, memorial) has `TitleEn` / `TitleNe` columns in the Sheet.
- Invitation cards and name tags support all three modes.

