## 5. Feature List (all toggleable)

### 5.1 Registration (required for all guests)
Every registered guest must fill in their details:
- Full name (English + Nepali optional)
- Phone, email
- Date of birth (used for drinking age band)
- Side: Bride / Groom / Both
- Relation (e.g., Mama, Fupu, Friend, Colleague) — dropdown + custom
- Number of people attending (≤ admin's admit count)
- Attending each invited event: Yes / No / Maybe
- Meal preference (Veg / Non-veg / Vegan / Jain) and allergies
- Arrival/departure date (if travelling)
- Accommodation request — **only shown if admin enabled it for that guest**
- Consent checkbox

### 5.2 Real-time Attendance Dashboard (admin)
- Auto-refresh every **20 seconds** from static `live.json` (no Apps Script load).
- Totals: Invited · Registered · Attending · Not attending · Maybe · Pending.
- Headcount per event (with plus-ones).
- Meal counts per event (for caterer).
- Bride side vs groom side counts.
- Drinking-eligible count (for bar planning).
- Accommodation: requested / assigned / rooms left.
- Checked-in now (live during the event).
- Export CSV for caterers / venue.

### 5.3 Accommodation (admin-managed only)
- Admin marks guests as **AccommodationEligible** (only they see the option).
- Admin defines rooms/hotels (`Rooms` tab: name, capacity, location, check-in/out).
- Guests request: nights, number of people, special needs.
- Admin approves and assigns rooms; guest sees assignment on their pass.
- Admin can close requests anytime.

### 5.4 Age Verification & Drinking Band
- DOB collected at registration → age computed **server-side**.
- Legal drinking age is an admin setting (default **18**).
- Status flow: `Under age` · `Self-declared 18+` · `ID verified ✅`.
- At check-in, volunteer verifies ID → marks **Verified**.
- Digital guest pass shows band color:
  - 🟢 **Green** — verified, may be served alcohol
  - 🟡 **Yellow** — self-declared, verify ID at bar
  - 🔴 **Red** — under age / not served alcohol
- Printable **wristband** strips (name + color + QR).
- Bar staff scan QR → see band status.
- Guests can choose "I don't drink" → band shows 🔵 non-drinker (no judgement, just mocktails).

### 5.5 Name Tags with Relation
- Auto-generated printable name tags for all registered guests.
- Shows: Name (EN/NE), **relation tag** (e.g., "Bride's Mama · दुलहीका मामा"), side color, QR code, optional drinking band dot.
- Side colors: Bride side (e.g., marigold), Groom side (e.g., maroon) — customizable.
- Print layout: A4 sheet, 8 tags per page; also single-tag print.
- Language mode applies to tags.

### 5.6 Guests & Personalization
- CSV import, unique ID, personal link `?g=XXXX`, personal QR code.
- Personalized welcome ("नमस्ते, Sharma परिवार 🙏").
- Groups: Family, Friends, VIP, Bride side, Groom side, custom.

### 5.7 Invitation Card Generator
- Nepali Hindu templates: Ganesh, mandala, marigold, Dhaka pattern, temple arch.
- Devanagari fonts, shloka, parents' names, Mom's blessing line (*"स्वर्गीय ______ को आशीर्वादसहित"*).
- Personalized per guest with QR; PNG / PDF / animated web invite.
- Bulk generate to Drive; share via WhatsApp / email / native share.
- Tracking: sent · opened · registered.

### 5.8 Events & Reveal System
- Typical Nepali wedding events: Swayambar/Tilak, Mehendi, Haldi, Sangeet, Janti (Baraat), Swagat, Kanyadan, Sindurdan, Saptapadi, Bidaai, Ghar Bhitryaune, Reception.
- Reveal styles: 🔒 timed · ✉️ envelope · 🪔 diya · 🎟️ scratch · 🔑 code · 🎁 daily unlock · 👥 group-only.
- Server-side filtering only. Muhurat countdown. Maps, dress code, Add to Calendar.

### 5.9 Live & Notifications (free)
- "What's Happening Now" banner (polling).
- Gmail confirmations/reminders.
- WhatsApp click-to-chat links (unlimited, free).
- Find my table, coordinator help button.

### 5.10 Photos, Videos & Wishes
- Resumable upload direct to Drive (large videos), moderation queue, gallery, live photo wall, video blessings.

### 5.11 Fun & Cultural
- Ritual explainer cards (EN/NE), Saptapadi vows, family tree.
- Joota Lukaune game, couple quiz, antakshari scoreboard, polls, song requests, Sangeet signup, lucky draw.
- Shagun QR (eSewa / Khalti / bank QR image uploaded by admin).

### 5.12 In Loving Memory of Mom 🙏
- Memorial page: tribute header, life story, her words, favorite songs, recipes, gallery.
- Everyone participates: 🪔 light a diya (live counter), memory wall (text/photo/voice/video), letters to Mom (private/shared), 🌸 pushpanjali, "how I knew her".
- Presence throughout: invite blessing line, home page card, **moment of remembrance** before Kanyadan/Saptapadi, reserved seat, photos on live wall, Sangeet tribute.
- Keepsakes: digital memory book (PDF), memory slideshow, permanent page.
- Sensitivity: moderation ON by default, private letters never public, calm design, visibility per group.

### 5.13 Check-in & PWA
- QR check-in (volunteer), ID verification for drinking band, offline PWA.

### 5.13a Side Themes (auto)
- Bride side → **Gulabi Marigold** (rose pink `#c2185b` + marigold `#f4a300`).
- Groom side → **Royal Peacock** (peacock teal `#0f5c63` + gold `#d4a017`).
- Applied automatically from the guest's side; colors editable; toggle `feature.sideThemes`.

### 5.13b Install as App (iOS & Android)
- Manifest + service worker + PNG icons; full-screen, bottom tab bar, safe-area aware.
- **📲 Install app** button: one-tap on Android; guided steps on iOS; detects WhatsApp/Instagram in-app browsers.

### 5.13c Auto Turn-off
- After `wedding.endDate` guest features are disabled server-side and a thank-you screen is shown.
- Memorial can stay open (`app.keepMemorialAfterEnd`).

### 5.14 After the Wedding
- Thank-you pages, highlight video, stats, archive mode.

