## 10. Security Checklist
- [ ] Locked/hidden events filtered server-side.
- [ ] Guest IDs random, 8 chars.
- [ ] Admin passcode stored in Apps Script **Script Properties** (never in the repo).
- [ ] Guests never receive other guests' phone/email/DOB.
- [ ] DOB visible only to admin; guests see only band color.
- [ ] Accommodation option returned only for eligible guests.
- [ ] Uploads go to private Pending folders; moderation before display.
- [ ] Use a dedicated personal Google account (not a work account).

---

## 11. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Apps Script latency (1–2s) | Loading states, browser caching |
| Gmail daily limit | WhatsApp links for bulk; email only confirmations |
| Polling ≠ true realtime / 30-execution limit | Phones poll static `live.json` on GitHub Pages every 20s (published by `Live.gs`) with API fallback |
| Simultaneous writes corrupting rows | Public write actions run inside a script lock (`withLock_`) |
| Stale guest data | Versioned cache keys invalidated on every write; TTL capped at next reveal |
| Silent failures on the day | Hourly `healthCheck` email; see [docs/DAY_OF.md](docs/DAY_OF.md) |
| Fake DOB | ID verification at check-in → green band only after verification |
| Weak venue Wi-Fi | PWA offline pass; printed name tags/wristbands |
| Hosting in work OneDrive | Move repo to a personal folder before publishing |

